Package: phylodisc
Type: Package
Title: Tools for Analysing Discrete Phylogenetic Character Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Elizabeth", "Steell", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "104013969+LizzySteell@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Tools for analysing discrete (typically morphological) character
    data in a phylogenetic context, including matrix homoplasy indices (RHI,
    HSR, HER), handling of polymorphisms, uncertainties and invariant
    characters, support for ordered multistate characters using cost matrices,
    and helpers for building 'phyDat' objects and 'MrBayes' partition blocks.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Imports: ape, phangorn, stats, graphics
Suggests: corHMM, geiger, fitdistrplus, TreeTools
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.1
URL: https://github.com/LizzySteell/phylodisc
BugReports: https://github.com/LizzySteell/phylodisc/issues
